{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"おとといは神宮外苑花火大会でした☆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木坂46を初めて見るという方が多かったと思いますが"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"手を振ってくださったり笑顔で見てくださってうれしかったです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/erika.ikuta/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/13/8552100/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"花火は見れなかったのー(′;ω;)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だけど球場で歌うっていうのはなかなかできない経験"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/erika.ikuta/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/13/8552100/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今までで一番大きい会場で、気持ちよかったです(o^∀^o)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それとお誕生日のメンバー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"8/10あしゅりん！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ヾ(´・∀・)ノ << Happy Birthday♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あしゅかはねー、よく絡むんだけどほんとに楽しいです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/erika.ikuta/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/13/8552100/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"誕生日の日に「おめでとー」って体を持ち上げたら"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そのまま20秒くらい上げてられました(o^v^o)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"軽すぎっそれにかわいいっ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/erika.ikuta/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/13/8552100/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これからもいっぱい喋ろうね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/erika.ikuta/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/13/8552100/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日は柏ちゃんの誕生日でした"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/erika.ikuta/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/13/8552100/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"HappyBirthdayヽ(・ω・〃)。・:*:"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"美人さんだけど褒めると全力で否定する柏ちゃん(^w^)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近会えないことが多いね。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも真面目に勉強やっててすごいと思う。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"大変かもしれないけど一緒に頑張ろうね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/erika.ikuta/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/13/8552100/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"明日、明後日は乃木坂46の初ライブだっ！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日も一日中みんなでリハーサルしてましたo(^-^)o"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"楽しみだしやっぱりすごくドキドキしてます"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/erika.ikuta/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/13/8552100/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"精一杯頑張るぞ！ヾ(●｀・ω・´●)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"来てくださる方、盛り上がっていきましょーっ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/erika.ikuta/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/13/8552100/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/erika.ikuta/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/13/8552100/0009.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"エリカ(。・∀・。)☆彡"}],"source":"archive"}